Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:13.91,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I start a \Njourney with you, we can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:27.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Traveling from sea to sea{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:32.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that it's just a fantasy{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:39.19,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are tons of unimaginable truth{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:43.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't turn a blind eye{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:50.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Common sense is just the mind of the masses{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:57.26,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never seen the end of \Nthe world with my own eyes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:02.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why we've got to go, \NCaptain Live-By-My-Own-Rules{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:07.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who says it's impossible? \NNothing has started yet{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:12.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to know everything now, yes, we can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:16.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, we can! You can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:18.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This moment{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:21.61,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can! I can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:24.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This great feeling{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, now, yes, we can!{\i0}
